  "details": "For people making videos of their worlds - having a very constrained FoV for the desktop view is pretty limiting when trying to capture VR interactions.\nHaving a configuration option (even if in JSON, similar to camera resolution settings) would allow for better in-world captures of the first person perspective. Without causing motion sickness for the viewers, like when using VR View in SteamVR/Oculus",
